        <isactr:FieldObject Name="prompt" Type="FieldArgument">
          <isactr:FieldObject.Value>
            <InArgument x:TypeArguments="x:String" xml:space="preserve">This is a photo of a vehicle that was involved in an accident. Describe the damage degree for each part of the vehicle in a table.

Only the visible parts should be described. No comment should be made on invisible parts.

I want the whole output to be formatted in two html tables. If no relevant data is available for a table, don't display its rows

The first one should have three columns : vehicle part, damage description and damage degree from 0 to 10 (0 being not damaged, and 10 being completely damaged).

Just mention the eight most damaged parts, if applicable.

The second table should have two columns. Its name is Vehicle Data and it should be displayed as a h2 header. Each row should contain the name of a property on the first column and the property's value on the second column.

The first property is called 'Vehicle ID' . For the first property's value, you should retrieve, if visible, the license plate of the vehicle from the image, or the id of the vehicle. It should be a 7 characters code.

The next property is called 'Mileage' . For its value, you should retrieve, if visible, the number of miles travelled, as shown on the dashboard of the car, on the odometer.

Do not output any additional text beyond the html tables and their names.</InArgument>
          </isactr:FieldObject.Value>
        </isactr:FieldObject>
